        <mxCell id="hdr_sub" value="Responsive web only (native apps excluded). Verified at 390 px, 768 px and desktop widths (Delivery Plan §5). Layout patterns below are a proposal — the SRS mandates responsiveness and accessibility, not a specific layout.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#666666'&gt;&lt;i&gt;Traceability: FR-UX-001…003, FR-BRD-004, NFR-06; SRS §2 exclusions; Delivery Plan §5&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
